WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.570
- You might recognize Rachel Powell

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:04.860
as the woman who participated
in the January 6th riots,

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.000
and then when the judge ordered her

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.626
to wear a mask pending
her release from prison,

00:00:09.626 --> 00:00:13.350
she defied that by wearing a
mask that was nothing but mesh,

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.720
in clear defiance of the judge's wishes.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.040
- Good morning, everybody.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.110
Welcome to Mr. Bookman's page.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.010
- But not surprising, when
she posted these photos

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.400
to social media, the judge issued an OSC

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.233
in order to show cause

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:26.110
why he shouldn't bring
the hammer down on her

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.750
for her obvious defiance of his order.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.150
Well not surprisingly, Rachel
Powell apologized to the judge

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.090
and said that, well, she was misguided

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:38.060
by Lana Del Ray who had
some sort of clear mask.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.440
Sorry about that, judge.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.550
You really just can't make any of this up,

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.353
which is why I'll probably
see her and you in court.

